                <pb facs="0309" n="197" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg197"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/3707: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            notAfter="1919-01-25T09:29:00-05:00"
                            notBefore="1919-01-24T00:00:00+04:53"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >undated</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received January 25, 1919, 9:29
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Following from [Harris at] Omsk:</p>
                <p>“54. 24th. Orenburg was occupied by Bolsheviks on January 22d. Harris.”</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
